    "body_text": "Pack of 25 Pieces\n\nThis 12-inch round plate is designed for family-style dining and buffets. Made from naturally fallen Areca leaves, it’s large, sturdy, and perfect for serving everything from roasts to desserts. Fully compostable, this plate makes cleanup easy and eco-friendly.\n\nPRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS\n\n• Colour – Each one has its own unique variation in texture and color (compliments of Mother Nature)\n\n• Odour – None\n\n• Taste – None\n\n• Shape – Round\n\n• Top Diameter - 305 mm\n\n• Bottom Diameter - 297 mm\n\n• Weight - 15 Gram\n\n• Internal Volume – 2360 ml\n\nPRODUCT FEATURES\n\n• 100% Biodegradable\n\n• 100% Home and Industrial Compostable\n\n• Made from Pure Areca Palm Leaves\n\n• Naturally sturdy with no added chemicals\n\n• 100% Compostable\n\n• 100% Natural\n\n• No binders, fillers, coating or liners\n\n• Can be used for hot and cold foods\n\n• Microwave safe up to +180 °C\n\n• Freezer safe up to – 20 °C\n\n• Water proof / Leak proof",
